titution, mental-health mitigation, and post-arrest compliance."],"counterarguments":["The comparator cases are not identical; Gilbert and Cunningham contain aggravating factors, and Jarrett includes an aggravated-robbery firearm specification.","Community-control eligibility can turn on individualized statutory findings and mitigation not visible in news reporting."],"limitations":["The exact August 2026 Williamson sentencing entry and transcript have not yet been captured.","The comparator set is small and non-random."],"unresolved":["Exact R.C. 2929.13(D)(2) findings used by the sentencing court.","Exact community-control conditions, reserve term, restitution, and violation consequences."],"confidence":0.88},"dataset":"violent-offenders","date_added":"2026-08-07T21:45:00Z","date_updated":"2026-08-07T21:45:00Z","dtype":"analysis","evidence":[],"schema_version":"0.9.0","sources":[],"status":"supported","title":"Franklin County sentencing disparity analysis — Marcus Williamson","version":1}
